     : ProjectionExec: expr=[NULL as col_1, parent_id@0 as col_2, NULL as col_3, id@1 as col_4, ctid_0@2 as ctid_0], metrics=[output_rows=2, output_bytes=336.0 B, output_batches=1]
     :   HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=RightSemi, on=[(id@0, parent_id@1)], projection=[parent_id@1, id@3, ctid_0@0], fetch=2, metrics=[output_rows=2, output_bytes=336.0 B, output_batches=1, build_mem_used=194.0 B, array_map_created_count=0, build_input_batches=1, build_input_rows=2, input_batches=1, input_rows=3, avg_fanout=100% (3/3), probe_hit_rate=100% (3/3)]
     :     CooperativeExec
     :       PgSearchScan: table=p, segments={included=1, pruned=1}, visibility=eager, query={"boolean":{"must":[{"with_index":{"query":{"all":{"field":"id"}}}},{"term_set":{"terms":[{"field":"category","value":"alpha"}]}},{"range":{"field":"metadata.score","lower_bound":{"included":20.0},"upper_bound":null}},{"range":{"field":"metadata.score","lower_bound":null,"upper_bound":{"included":30.0}}}]}}, metrics=[output_rows=2, output_bytes=104.0 B, output_batches=1]
     :     VisibilityFilterExec: tables=[c], metrics=[output_rows=3, output_bytes=348.0 B, output_batches=1, ctids_fetched=3, ctids_lazy=0]
     :       CooperativeExec
     :         PgSearchScan: table=c, segments=1, lazy_sort=4, eager=[id], dynamic_filters=1, query={"with_index":{"query":{"all":{"field":"id"}}}}, metrics=[output_rows=3, output_bytes=348.0 B, output_batches=1, dynamic_filter_pushdown_bitset_from_postings=1, queries=1, rows_pruned=0, rows_scanned=3]
